# Normalise line endings to LF in the repo and the working tree on every platform.
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks files out as CRLF while
# Prettier defaults to endOfLine "lf", so `npm run format:check` fails locally
# even though CI (Linux) passes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.docx binary
*.doc binary
